memories-pc: The game's disc image was not found.

This port needs your own copy of Yu-Gi-Oh! Forbidden Memories (USA, SLUS-01411) as a raw .bin image (the .bin of a .bin/.cue pair). Put it in the "game" folder next to the program:

/workspace/work/hal20-base/repo/tmp/pc/game32/game

Any file name ending in .bin will do.
